      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَبَابِ</span></b>  [an imperative verbal n.,] a call to a
female hyena, signifying <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دِبِّى</span> [i. e. <i>Creep along;</i>
or <i>crawl;</i> or <i>go leisurely</i>]: (Sb, T, K:) like
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَزَالِ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَذَارِ</span>. (Sb, T.)

